BT /F2 12 Tf 40 385 Td (Method) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 40 367 Td (1. Peel the potatoes and slice them thinly, and slice the onion.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 40 352 Td (2. Cook both gently in the oil for 20 minutes, soft but not browned.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 40 337 Td (3. Drain, keeping 2 tbsp of oil; mix into the beaten, salted eggs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 40 322 Td (4. Cook in a 24 cm pan for 5 minutes on a low heat.) Tj ET
